00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:03,446
Qabulxonangizda bemorlar navbatda kutyaptimi?

2
00:00:03,396 --> 00:00:09,093
Med.uz.ai bilan bemor Telegram orqali o‘zi qabulga yoziladi, eslatmani o‘zi oladi.

3
00:00:09,093 --> 00:00:13,680
Registrator jadvalni telefonida ko‘radi: kim keldi, kim kechikdi.

4
00:00:13,680 --> 00:00:16,711
Navbat yo‘q, telefon qo‘ng‘iroqlari yo‘q.

5
00:00:16,711 --> 00:00:19,187
Bepul demo — med.uz.ai.

